305
00:27:18,985 --> 00:27:21,905
(Ravin ChaiChan)

306
00:27:26,105 --> 00:27:27,105
Mm.

307
00:27:29,625 --> 00:27:30,745
Why are you giving me a gun?

308
00:27:31,025 --> 00:27:32,425
You want me to shoot now?

309
00:27:33,065 --> 00:27:34,345
Look carefully first.

310
00:27:39,225 --> 00:27:40,464
(Sasin Ngaochan)

311
00:27:40,465 --> 00:27:43,145
(Sasin Ngaochan)
- That way, you’ll feel like I’m always beside you.

312
00:27:44,745 --> 00:27:46,825
I want you by my side all the time too.

313
00:27:50,265 --> 00:27:51,265
This part is mine.

314
00:27:55,825 --> 00:28:00,745
(Ravin ChaiChan)

315
00:28:02,865 --> 00:28:04,665
