316
00:28:05,145 --> 00:28:06,744
Right now, we still don’t know.

317
00:28:06,745 --> 00:28:08,344
And there are no witnesses yet.

318
00:28:08,345 --> 00:28:10,144
The body was abandoned deep in the forest.

319
00:28:10,145 --> 00:28:11,464
