539
00:52:04,025 --> 00:52:07,145
-can matter even more than what society calls "correct".

540
00:52:08,905 --> 00:52:12,225
Marriage equality is not just about obtaining legal documents.

541
00:52:13,585 --> 00:52:19,065
It is about receiving equal rights in love.

542
00:52:39,745 --> 00:52:40,905
I’m happy.

543
00:52:44,785 --> 00:52:45,985
About what?

544
00:52:50,225 --> 00:52:52,105
Being with the person I love.

545
00:52:55,825 --> 00:52:56,825
Look at you...

546
00:52:56,826 --> 00:52:58,704
back then you barely even talked.

547
00:52:58,705 --> 00:53:00,145
But now you're confessing your love.

548
00:53:07,585 --> 00:53:10,105
Can you keep making me this happy forever?

549
00:53:11,025 --> 00:53:12,185
And How do I do that?

550
00:53:16,945 --> 00:53:18,905
We'll just grow old together.

551
00:53:45,625 --> 00:53:49,145
(As the sunlight slowly fades away, )

552
00:53:49,665 --> 00:53:53,385
(all I need is someone by my side.)

553
00:53:53,745 --> 00:53:57,665
(Let it be you, let it be you.)

554
00:53:57,905 --> 00:54:01,585
(Just sitting close, meeting your eyes, warms my heart.)

555
00:54:01,785 --> 00:54:05,864
(Let this moment be just the two of us.)

556
00:54:05,865 --> 00:54:09,505
(Like the moon waiting for its time to shine.)

557
00:54:09,785 --> 00:54:13,905
(Let it be you, can it be you?)

558
00:54:14,145 --> 00:54:18,465
(The one who stays by my side and never leaves.)

559
00:54:20,185 --> 00:54:26,105
(Let it be you…)

